sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as OGXServer Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Controller as OGXServer Controller
    participant Kustomize as Kustomize Pipeline<br/>(in-process)
    participant OGXPod as OGX Server Pod<br/>8080/TCP HTTP

    Note over User,OGXPod: Flow 1: OGXServer Reconciliation

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply OGXServer CR
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-ogx-io-v1beta1-ogxserver<br/>TLS (OpenShift profile)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Allowed / Denied
    K8sAPI-->>User: CR created/rejected

    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event: OGXServer created<br/>ServiceAccount token auth
    Controller->>Kustomize: Render manifests<br/>(base + transformers)
    Kustomize-->>Controller: Deployment, Service, PVC,<br/>NetworkPolicy, PDB, HPA,<br/>ServiceMonitor, PrometheusRule
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Server-side apply<br/>field owner: ogx-operator<br/>ServiceAccount token auth
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Resources applied
    Controller->>OGXPod: GET /v1/version<br/>HTTP 8080/TCP (health check)
    OGXPod-->>Controller: Version response
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Update OGXServer status

    Note over User,OGXPod: Flow 2: OGX Module Component Deployment

    participant Platform as ODH/RHOAI<br/>Platform Operator
    participant Module as ogx-module Controller

    Platform->>K8sAPI: Create OGX CR<br/>(cluster-scoped)
    K8sAPI->>Module: Watch event: OGX CR created<br/>ServiceAccount token auth
    Module->>Module: Render kustomize overlay<br/>(ODH or RHOAI variant)
    Module->>K8sAPI: Deploy root operator resources<br/>ServiceAccount token auth

    Note over User,OGXPod: Flow 3: Metrics Collection

    participant Prometheus as Prometheus
    participant Proxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Metrics as Controller Metrics<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS

    Prometheus->>Proxy: GET /metrics<br/>HTTPS TLS (service-ca)<br/>Bearer token
    Proxy->>K8sAPI: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview
    K8sAPI-->>Proxy: Authorized
    Proxy->>Metrics: Forward request<br/>Authenticated
    Metrics-->>Proxy: Metrics response
    Proxy-->>Prometheus: Metrics data
